ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T15:54:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T15:54:35Z","body":"My mistake, this should be fixed now with the latest push :D","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504230590/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504441145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99754#issuecomment-2504441145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99754","id":2504441145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VRr05","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T17:37:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T17:37:53Z","body":"For reference, this is what it currently says (in case it gets updated in the future):\r\n\r\n> remains anchored in a fixed position on the screen and does not move with the camera. If disabled, the [CanvasLayer] will move along with the camera's transform\r\n\r\nThis wording still feels ambiguous to me, like both descriptions for true/false are saying the same thing.\r\n\r\n\"*Remains anchored in a fixed position on the screen* and *does not move with the camera*\" sound contradictory - if it remains in a fixed position on the *screen* (not the world), but the camera moves, then it should look like it is moving with the camera within the world space, because the camera is our view into the world.\r\n\r\n\"Moving along with the camera's transform\" sounds to me like, if you scroll the camera to the right for example, the CanvasLayer will move to the right as well (\"along with the camera's transform\"), and thus appear to be in a fixed position on the screen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504441145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504459768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99754#issuecomment-2504459768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99754","id":2504459768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VRwX4","user":{"login":"kthang55","id":35669918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NjY5OTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35669918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55","html_url":"https://github.com/kthang55","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kthang55/starred{/owner}{/repo}"